{"doc_id": "209ff2190e47b6d02169d1d985f8e1c3f04354a4166ec42d45e2e8a626800a4f", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "eligibility", "status": "present", "value_ja": null, "normalized": {"items": [{"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "予算決算及び会計令（以下「予決令」という。）第70条の規定に該当しない者であること。\nなお、未成年者、被保佐人又は被補助人であって、契約締結のために必要な同意を得ている者は、同条中、特別の理由がある場合に該当する。", "text_en": "Must not fall under Article 70 of the Budget, Settlement and Accounting Regulations (except minors, persons under curatorship, or persons under assistance who have obtained necessary consent).", "citations": ["p3_s3", "p3_s4"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "予決令第71条の規定に該当しない者であること。", "text_en": "Must not fall under Article 71 of the Budget, Settlement and Accounting Regulations.", "citations": ["p3_s5"]}, {"kind": "unified_qualification", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "令和７･８･９年度国土交通省競争参加資格（全省庁統一資格）「物品の販売」において「Ａ」又は「Ｂ」等級に格付けされ関東・甲信越地域の競争参加資格を有する者であること。", "text_en": "Must hold FY2025-2027 MLIT unified qualification in 'Sale of Goods', Grade A or B, for the Kanto-Koshinetsu region.", "citations": ["p3_s6"]}, {"kind": "certification", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "電気事業法第２条の２の規定に基づき小売電気事業の登録を受けている者であること。", "text_en": "Must be registered as a retail electricity provider under Article 2-2 of the Electricity Business Act.", "citations": ["p3_s7"]}, {"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "予決令第73条の規定に基づき支出負担行為担当官が定める入札参加資格として、省ＣＯ２化の要素を考慮する観点から、入札説明書に記載する基準を満たす者であること。", "text_en": "Must meet the CO2-reduction criteria stated in the bid instructions under Article 73 of the Budget, Settlement and Accounting Regulations.", "citations": ["p4_s1"]}, {"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "電子調達システムによる場合は、電子認証（ICカード）を取得していること。", "text_en": "If participating via the electronic procurement system, must hold an electronic certificate (IC card).", "citations": ["p4_s2"]}, {"kind": "other", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "入札説明書の交付を受けた者であること。", "text_en": "Must have received the bid instructions.", "citations": ["p4_s3"]}, {"kind": "suspension", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "気象衛星センターから指名停止の措置を受けている期間中の者でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be under suspension of designation by the Meteorological Satellite Center.", "citations": ["p4_s4"]}, {"kind": "legal", "polarity": "requirement", "text_ja": "警察当局から、暴力団員が実質的に経営を支配する者又はこれに準ずる者として、国土交通省公共事業等からの排除要請があり、当該状態が継続している者でないこと。", "text_en": "Must not be subject to an ongoing police request for exclusion from MLIT public works due to organized crime control or equivalent status.", "citations": ["p4_s5"]}]}, "value_en": "Nine competitive bidding eligibility requirements covering Articles 70 and 71 of the Budget, Settlement and Accounting Regulations, FY2025-2027 unified qualification, retail electricity registration, CO2-reduction criteria, IC card electronic certificate, receipt of bid instructions, non-suspension, and exclusion of organized crime-related entities.", "citations": ["p3_s3", "p3_s4", "p3_s5", "p3_s6", "p3_s7", "p4_s1", "p4_s2", "p4_s3", "p4_s4", "p4_s5"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "accepted A; Nine conditions p3_s3 to p4_s5, one item each. The minors exception p3_s4 stays inside the 第70条 item (guide, gold wave 1). The 第73条 item p4_s1 is kind other (D-71). All items keep the negation as requirement, the consistent form. p4_s6 is about when to apply for the qualification, not a condition, so it is correctly left out. B has no valid items (schema failure).", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "web"}}
